'''Cassidy''', originally named '''McCree''' until 2021, is a [[Sub-Roles#Sharpshooter|Sharpshooter]] [[Roles#Damage|Damage]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. He is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Cassidy HS.mp4|left|thumb]]
Armed with his Peacekeeper revolver, Cassidy takes out targets with deadeye precision and dives out of danger with eagle-like speed.

