| Ramattra_matchup = Ramattra's {{al|Void Accelerator}} has no damage falloff, allowing him to pressure Cassidy well outside of the {{al|Peacekeeper}}'s effective range. Up close, his {{al|Nemesis Form}} poses a severe threat; his {{al|Pummel}} strikes pierce through all targets and his movement speed is increased, meaning {{al|Combat Roll}} will rarely create enough distance for Cassidy to escape safely. Furthermore, Ramattra's {{al|Block}} drastically reduces all incoming frontal damage. Even a fully charged {{al|Deadeye}} will struggle to eliminate a full-health Ramattra who is actively blocking. Cassidy should maintain high ground and strictly engage Ramattra while he is in his Omnic form, exploiting his large head hitbox.
| Ramattra_synergy = 
| Reinhardt_rating = STRONG MATCHUP
| Reinhardt_risk = MEDIUM RISK
| Reinhardt_synergy_rating = 
| Reinhardt_matchup = Reinhardt's massive {{al|Barrier Field}} and high health pool allow him to withstand most of Cassidy's standard poke damage, and his {{al|Rocket Hammer}} will effortlessly crush Cassidy in close-quarters combat. While Cassidy can throw a {{al|Flashbang}} over Reinhardt's shield to temporarily Hinder him and drop the barrier, following up with {{al|Fan the Hammer}} is usually insufficient to kill him and will leave Cassidy in lethal melee range. Instead, Cassidy should utilize his superior range and mobility to take off-angles, shooting around or above the shield. When utilizing {{al|Deadeye}}, Cassidy fires from right to left; if Reinhardt's shield is low on health and multiple enemies are hiding behind it, the first shot may shatter the shield, allowing the successive shots to instantly eliminate the exposed targets behind him.
| Reinhardt_synergy = 
| Roadhog_rating = EVEN MATCHUP
| Roadhog_risk = EXTREME RISK
| Roadhog_synergy_rating = 
| Roadhog_matchup = As long as Cassidy maintains his distance, Roadhog serves as a massive target for farming ultimate charge. His large hitbox makes landing continuous headshots very easy. However, Roadhog's {{al|Chain Hook}} is a guaranteed death sentence for Cassidy. If hooked, Cassidy lacks the defensive utility to survive the follow-up {{al|Scrap Gun}} blast. Up close, {{al|Flashbang}} and {{al|Fan the Hammer}} will rarely kill a Roadhog, as he can simply use {{al|Take a Breather}} to mitigate the damage and heal. However, if timed perfectly, Flashbang can be used to interrupt Take a Breather, denying him his primary sustain. Cassidy must ensure Roadhog is distracted or his hook is on cooldown before activating {{al|Deadeye}}, as a hook will instantly cancel the ultimate.
| Roadhog_synergy = 
| Sigma_rating = EVEN MATCHUP
| Sigma_risk = MEDIUM RISK
| Sigma_synergy_rating = STRONG SYNERGY
| Sigma_matchup = Sigma possesses a versatile toolkit that can heavily disrupt Cassidy's rhythm. His {{al|Hyperspheres}} deal massive burst damage, and his {{al|Experimental Barrier}} can be repositioned dynamically to block Cassidy's shots or completely shut down his {{al|Deadeye}} sightlines. {{al|Accretion}} can stun Cassidy out of his ultimate or leave him vulnerable to follow-up fire. Most importantly, {{al|Kinetic Grasp}} will absorb Cassidy's primary fire, {{al|Fan the Hammer}}, and Deadeye shots, converting them into Overhealth. Cassidy should bait out Kinetic Grasp with primary fire before committing to a duel or using his abilities.
| Sigma_synergy = Sigma's {{al|Experimental Barrier}} provides a safe staging ground for Cassidy to apply mid-range pressure. Additionally, Sigma's {{al|Accretion}} knocks targets to the ground, providing Cassidy with a stationary target for an easy {{al|Fan the Hammer}} execution. The strongest synergy lies in their ultimates: using {{al|Deadeye}} during Sigma's {{al|Gravitic Flux}} guarantees that enemies are suspended in the air without cover, making them exceptionally easy to lock onto and eliminate before the slam even occurs.
| Winston_rating = WEAK MATCHUP
| Winston_risk = HIGH RISK
| Winston_synergy_rating = 
| Winston_matchup = Winston's high mobility and barrier make him a difficult target for Cassidy to isolate. His {{al|Barrier Projector}} can block Cassidy's shots and prevent him from peeling for his Supports. If Winston dives Cassidy, his high health pool allows him to absorb a full {{al|Fan the Hammer}} volley with ease, while his {{al|Tesla Cannon}} outputs consistent, un-missable damage that will quickly whittle Cassidy down. However, Cassidy's {{al|Flashbang}} is an excellent peeling tool; Hindering Winston mid-dive will prevent him from using his {{al|Jump Pack}} to escape, leaving his massive hitbox exposed to focused fire from Cassidy's team. Cassidy should avoid fighting Winston alone and strictly engage him alongside his team.
| Winston_synergy = 
