{{DevComment|Developer Comment: The overall goals for Magnetic Grenade are to shift its use from purely damage into more of a utility, and change its deployment behavior from a close-range lock-on to more of an aimed projectile that magnetizes if it gets close to an enemy target. The previous "Stuck" banner text alert confused Tracer's Pulse Bomb message, so this mobility-locking status effect is being referred to as "Hindered.”}}

{{al|Magnetic Grenade}}
